Z||000006||HummelHund||05-03-2001||10:58 PM||||Thanks 85Josh, I'll try some of the stuff mentioned in the posts. I haven't changed my breather filter yet, and last time when I tried to change the valve cover gasket (I didn't use silicon, and apparently on Fieros you MUST use silicon even with a rubber gasket) the filter looked pretty tired, so I'll change it first to see if that does anything. At least doing that'll get me an honest reading when I do the poor man's compression test mentioned in the post. <BR>Thanks<BR><P>------------------<BR>Sean W.<BR>'84 SE 2M4 WS6 (restoration project to become daily driver)<BR>'84 Sport Coupe ($150 running car)||||reg||1
